      "sha256": "3bde992c41d002974035755474474561fd18ae5c265ecff32af74c366bf6bb86",
      "text": "'''Armoured zombies''' are spawned during the [[Arrav]] boss fight in [[The Curse of Arrav]], who leave behind venom pools wherever they walk. Stepping on these will inflict [[venom]] and deal up to 4 damage every [[tick]] if not moving; this stacks up to a maximum of 20 damage per tick if the player does not move.\n\nUsing ranged or magic is recommended as they have very low ranged and magic defence.\n[[file:The Curse of Arrav - fighting Arrav.png|thumb|left|300px|Armoured zombies leaving behind venom pools during the fight with Arrav.]]\n",
      "label": "Directly read lead/role context (bounded excerpt)"
    },
